# check runs every spec in the specs directory and exits 1 if one has an error.
cd $EXAMPLES/refund
exits 1 specval check
cmp stdout $WORK/all.txt
! stderr .

# The JSON format has the same findings.
exits 1 specval check --format json
cmp stdout $WORK/all.json

# check takes spec files as arguments. A passing spec exits 0.
exits 0 specval check specs/ORD-142.yaml
cmp stdout $WORK/one.txt

# Flags can come after the file arguments.
exits 1 specval check specs/ORD-144.yaml --format json
stdout '"rule": "SV001"'

# An unknown format is a usage error.
exits 2 specval check --format yaml
! stdout .
stderr '^specval: unknown format "yaml"$'

# A missing spec file is an error.
exits 2 specval check specs/nope.yaml
stderr 'specs/nope.yaml: open .*specs/nope.yaml: no such file or directory'

-- one.txt --
1 spec(s) checked: 0 error(s), 0 warning(s)
-- all.txt --
specs/ORD-143.yaml:8 error SV107 AC2 is not covered by any call (acceptance[1])
    fix: Add AC2 to `covers` on the call(s) that implement it, or add the missing call.
specs/ORD-143.yaml:10 error SV109 ShippingManager is not a registered service (services.changed[1])
    fix: If ShippingManager is new, move it to services.new with a layer and purpose. Otherwise use a registered service: OrderManager.
specs/ORD-143.yaml:14 error ORD001 OrderAccessor may not call PricingEngine (calls[2])
    fix: Have OrderManager call PricingEngine and pass the price to whoever needs it.
specs/ORD-143.yaml:14 error SV102 OrderAccessor (accessor) may not call PricingEngine (engine) (calls[2])
    fix: Accessors may call only resources. Route the call to PricingEngine through a manager instead.
specs/ORD-143.yaml:15 error SV101 RefundEngine is not a registered service (calls[3].to)
    fix: If RefundEngine is new, declare it under services.new with a layer and purpose. Otherwise use a registered service: PricingEngine.
specs/ORD-143.yaml:15 error SV108 AC4 is not an acceptance criterion in this spec (calls[3].covers[1])
    fix: Use one of: AC1, AC2, or add AC4 under acceptance.
specs/ORD-144.yaml:1 error SV001 acceptance is required
    fix: Add `acceptance`: Testable acceptance criteria; at least one.
specs/ORD-144.yaml:1 error SV001 calls is required
    fix: Add `calls`: Every service-to-service call the change adds or alters.
specs/ORD-144.yaml:1 error SV001 kind is required
    fix: Add `kind`: One of: feature, bugfix, chore.
specs/ORD-144.yaml:1 error SV001 summary is required
    fix: Add `summary`: A short paragraph: the problem and the intended behavior.
specs/ORD-144.yaml:1 error SV001 Additional property cals is not allowed
    fix: Remove `cals` or fix its name. Allowed here: acceptance, calls, id, kind, out_of_scope, services, specval, summary, title.
specs/ORD-144.yaml:2 error SV001 Does not match pattern '^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*$' (id)
    fix: Ticket id, e.g. ORD-142 (letters, digits, . _ -). The file is specs/<id>.yaml.
3 spec(s) checked: 12 error(s), 0 warning(s)
